msgid "No-... I-... Even if-... Nova would see-... N-not that I would...!"
msgstr "Nie... ja... Nawet gdyby... Nova by zobaczyła... N-nie żebym chciała...!"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "No-...! Please...! Khh...! D-don't leave...!"
msgstr "Nie...! Proszę...! Khh...! N-nie odchodź...!"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "No. This isn't right!"
msgstr "Nie. To nie jest w porządku!"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Bunnyboy"
msgid "No.. No... Hmm... No..."
msgstr "Nie... Nie... Hmm... Nie..."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "No... Everywhere is blocked off right now."
